Or what was left of it.

1361
01:05:51.159 --> 01:05:52.160
What?

1362
01:05:52.244 --> 01:05:54.162
Yeah. His wife. uh.
claims she didn't see him.

1363
01:05:54.246 --> 01:05:55.914
but I think she's going to jail.

1364
01:05:55.998 --> 01:05:58.667
