1365
01:05:58.750 --> 01:05:59.751
This is unbelievable.

1366
01:05:59.835 --> 01:06:02.963
Yeah. I'd assumed he would have told you.
Chuck. That's pretty weird.

1367
01:06:03.547 --> 01:06:05.966
Oh. he... Yeah. he did.
Of course... My dad.

1368
01:06:06.049 --> 01:06:09.303
Yeah. yeah. yeah. Um. when Neil's head
got run over by his wife...

1369
01:06:09.386 --> 01:06:10.762
-Oh.
-he got killed. and yeah.

1370
01:06:10.846 --> 01:06:13.408
-we of course talked about it. Of course.
-Oh. okay. So. you just...

1371
01:06:13.432 --> 01:06:15.100
'Cause I just told you the story just now

1372
01:06:15.184 --> 01:06:17.269
and you were saying you d...
