1373
01:06:17.352 --> 01:06:18.687
No. I'd heard it. for sure.

1374
01:06:18.770 --> 01:06:20.790
Okay. 'cause you were looking
pretty surprised when I said that.

1375
01:06:20.814 --> 01:06:21.815
-Nah.
-Yeah.

1376
01:06:21.899 --> 01:06:24.193
