-Yeah. uh...
-Yeah.

1378
01:06:25.360 --> 01:06:28.989
Good luck with the. uh.
Sexy. uh. Honey. I should go.

1379
01:06:29.072 --> 01:06:30.782
Yes. Sticky Honey and I don't use it.

1380
01:06:30.866 --> 01:06:32.969
